strategy-pattern.pseudocode:
class DiscountStrategy:  # Strategy 인터페이스
    def apply(self, price):
        raise NotImplementedError

class NoDiscount(DiscountStrategy):
    def apply(self, price):
        return price

class RateDiscount(DiscountStrategy):
    def __init__(self, rate):
        self.rate = rate
    def apply(self, price):
        return price * (1 - self.rate)

class Order:  # Context: 알고리즘을 모름
    def __init__(self, strategy):
        self.strategy = strategy
    def set_strategy(self, strategy):  # 런타임 교체
        self.strategy = strategy
    def total(self, price):
        return self.strategy.apply(price)  # 위임

